    "title": "Second Conditional",
    "title_ko": "2형 조건문",
    "focus_axis": "grammar"
  },
  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Second conditional (If + past simple, ... would + base verb) describes an unreal or unlikely present/future situation and its imagined result: 'If I won the lottery, I would travel the world.'",
    "explanation_ko": "2형 조건문(If + 과거시제, ... would + 동사원형)은 비현실적이거나 가능성이 낮은 현재·미래 상황과 그 상상된 결과를 나타냅니다: 'If I won the lottery, I would travel the world.'",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "If I had more time, I would learn to paint.",
        "ko": "시간이 더 있다면 그림을 배울 텐데요."
      },
      {
        "en": "What would you do if you were me?",
        "ko": "당신이 저라면 뭘 할 거예요?"
      },
      {
        "en": "I would help if I could.",
        "ko": "할 수 있다면 도와드릴 텐데요."
      }
    ]
  },
  "tasks": [
